{"seq":4,"slug":"named-groups-and-flags","title":"命名分组与标志位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/regex-text-processing/advanced-patterns/named-groups-and-flags","wordCount":851,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"命名分组与标志位\">命名分组与标志位</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>命名捕获组 <code>(?&lt;name&gt;...)</code> 为分组赋予语义化名称，让提取结果直接映射到对象字段；标志位（Flag）则在不改写模式的前提下调整引擎行为。二者共同决定了一段正则&quot;匹配什么&quot;与&quot;如何匹配&quot;。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>命名组引用：模式内 <code>\\k&lt;name&gt;</code>、替换串中 <code>$&lt;name&gt;</code>、JavaScript 中 <code>match.groups.name</code>。</li>\n<li>命名组同样占用数字编号，<code>match[1]</code> 与 <code>match.groups.year</code> 指向同一分组。</li>\n<li>JavaScript 共 8 个标志位：匹配行为（<code>g</code> <code>i</code>）、字符处理（<code>s</code> <code>u</code> <code>v</code>）、位置控制（<code>m</code> <code>y</code>）与元信息（<code>d</code>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"命名捕获组\">命名捕获组</h2><p>ES2018 引入了<strong>命名捕获组</strong>（Named Capturing Group），使用 <code>(?&lt;name&gt;...)</code> 语法为分组指定有意义的名称，大幅提升正则表达式的可读性和可维护性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const datePattern = /(?&lt;year&gt;\\d{4})-(?&lt;month&gt;\\d{2})-(?&lt;day&gt;\\d{2})/;&#10;const match = datePattern.exec(&#39;2026-04-01&#39;);&#10;match.groups.year;&#10;match.groups.month;&#10;match.groups.day;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> datePattern</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(?&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">year</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{4}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)-(?&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">month</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{2}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)-(?&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">day</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{2}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> match</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> datePattern.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-04-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">match.groups.year;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">match.groups.month;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">match.groups.day;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>引用方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>(?&lt;name&gt;...)</code></td>\n<td>定义命名组</td>\n<td><code>match.groups.name</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>\\k&lt;name&gt;</code></td>\n<td>模式内反向引用</td>\n<td>引用已匹配的文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>$&lt;name&gt;</code></td>\n<td>替换字符串引用</td>\n<td><code>replace</code> 中使用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const tag = /(?&lt;open&gt;&lt;(?&lt;tagName&gt;\\w+)&gt;)(?&lt;content&gt;.*?)(?&lt;close&gt;&lt;\\/\\k&lt;tagName&gt;&gt;)/;&#10;const result = tag.exec(&#39;&lt;div&gt;hello&lt;/div&gt;&#39;);&#10;result.groups.tagName;&#10;result.groups.content;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tag</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(?&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">open</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">>&#x3C;(?&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tagName</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)>)(?&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">content</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)(?&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">close</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">>&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\\k&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tagName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">>)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tag.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'&#x3C;div>hello&#x3C;/div>'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result.groups.tagName;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result.groups.content;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"图示\">图示</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    NAMED[&quot;命名分组&quot;] --&gt; DEF[&quot;定义 (?&lt;name&gt;...)&quot;]&#10;    NAMED --&gt; REF_P[&quot;模式引用 \\\\k&lt;name&gt;&quot;]&#10;    NAMED --&gt; REF_R[&quot;替换引用 $&lt;name&gt;&quot;]&#10;    NAMED --&gt; REF_J[&quot;JS 引用 groups.name&quot;]\">graph LR\n    NAMED[\"命名分组\"] --&gt; DEF[\"定义 (?&lt;name&gt;...)\"]\n    NAMED --&gt; REF_P[\"模式引用 \\\\k&lt;name&gt;\"]\n    NAMED --&gt; REF_R[\"替换引用 $&lt;name&gt;\"]\n    NAMED --&gt; REF_J[\"JS 引用 groups.name\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"命名组在替换中的应用\">命名组在替换中的应用</h2><p>命名捕获组使 <code>replace</code> 操作更加语义化，代码意图一目了然。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const isoDate = /(?&lt;year&gt;\\d{4})-(?&lt;month&gt;\\d{2})-(?&lt;day&gt;\\d{2})/g;&#10;&#10;&#39;2026-04-01&#39;.replace(isoDate, &#39;$&lt;day&gt;/$&lt;month&gt;/$&lt;year&gt;&#39;);&#10;&#10;&#39;2026-04-01&#39;.replace(isoDate, (_, _y, _m, _d, _o, _s, groups) =&gt; {&#10;  return `${groups.year}年${groups.month}月${groups.day}日`;&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> isoDate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(?&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">year</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{4}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)-(?&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">month</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{2}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)-(?&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">day</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{2}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-04-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">replace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(isoDate, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'$&#x3C;day>/$&#x3C;month>/$&#x3C;year>'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-04-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">replace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(isoDate, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">_y</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">_m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">_d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">_o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">_s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">groups</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">groups</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">year</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}年${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">groups</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">month</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}月${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">groups</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">day</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}日`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>命名组与解构赋值配合使用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const urlPattern = /(?&lt;protocol&gt;https?):\\/\\/(?&lt;host&gt;[^/:]+)(?::(?&lt;port&gt;\\d+))?(?&lt;path&gt;\\/[^?]*)?/;&#10;const {&#10;  groups: { protocol, host, port, path },&#10;} = urlPattern.exec(&#39;https://example.com:8080/api/users&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> urlPattern</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(?&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">>https</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">):</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\/\\/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(?&#x3C;</span><