dices-标志\">hasIndices 标志</h2><p><code>d</code> 标志（ES2022）为每个捕获组生成精确的开始和结束索引，通过 <code>match.indices</code> 访问。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const re = /(?&lt;year&gt;\\d{4})-(?&lt;month&gt;\\d{2})-(?&lt;day&gt;\\d{2})/d;&#10;const match = re.exec(&#39;Date: 2026-04-01&#39;);&#10;&#10;match.indices[0];&#10;match.indices[1];&#10;match.indices.groups.year;&#10;match.indices.groups.month;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> re</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(?&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">year</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{4}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)-(?&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">month</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{2}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)-(?&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">day</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{2}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> match</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> re.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Date: 2026-04-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">match.indices[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">match.indices[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">match.indices.groups.year;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">match.indices.groups.month;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>值</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>indices[0]</code></td>\n<td><code>[6, 16]</code></td>\n<td>完整匹配的范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>indices[1]</code></td>\n<td><code>[6, 10]</code></td>\n<td>年份分组的范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>indices.groups.year</code></td>\n<td><code>[6, 10]</code></td>\n<td>命名分组的范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>indices.groups.month</code></td>\n<td><code>[11, 13]</code></td>\n<td>命名分组的范围</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"图示\">图示</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;Date: 2026-04-01&quot;&#10;        D[&quot;D(0)&quot;] --- A[&quot;a(1)&quot;] --- T[&quot;t(2)&quot;] --- E[&quot;e(3)&quot;] --- COLON[&quot;:(4)&quot;] --- SP[&quot;(5)&quot;]&#10;        SP --- Y1[&quot;2(6)&quot;] --- Y2[&quot;0(7)&quot;] --- Y3[&quot;2(8)&quot;] --- Y4[&quot;6(9)&quot;]&#10;        Y4 --- H1[&quot;-(10)&quot;] --- M1[&quot;0(11)&quot;] --- M2[&quot;4(12)&quot;]&#10;        M2 --- H2[&quot;-(13)&quot;] --- D1[&quot;0(14)&quot;] --- D2[&quot;1(15)&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"Date: 2026-04-01\"\n        D[\"D(0)\"] --- A[\"a(1)\"] --- T[\"t(2)\"] --- E[\"e(3)\"] --- COLON[\":(4)\"] --- SP[\"(5)\"]\n        SP --- Y1[\"2(6)\"] --- Y2[\"0(7)\"] --- Y3[\"2(8)\"] --- Y4[\"6(9)\"]\n        Y4 --- H1[\"-(10)\"] --- M1[\"0(11)\"] --- M2[\"4(12)\"]\n        M2 --- H2[\"-(13)\"] --- D1[\"0(14)\"] --- D2[\"1(15)\"]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((命名分组与标志位))&#10;    命名捕获组&#10;      &quot;&amp;#40;?&lt;name&gt;...&amp;#41; 定义&quot;&#10;      &quot;\\\\k&lt;name&gt; 引用&quot;&#10;      &quot;$&lt;name&gt; 替换&quot;&#10;      解构赋值友好&#10;    标志位&#10;      g 全局&#10;      i 忽略大小写&#10;      m 多行&#10;      s dotAll&#10;      u Unicode&#10;      v unicodeSets&#10;      y sticky&#10;      d hasIndices&#10;    sticky 模式&#10;      精确位置匹配&#10;      词法分析利器&#10;      lastIndex 控制&#10;    hasIndices&#10;      捕获组索引&#10;      indices 属性&#10;      ES2022 新特性\">mindmap\n  root((命名分组与标志位))\n    命名捕获组\n      \"&amp;#40;?&lt;name&gt;...&amp;#41; 定义\"\n      \"\\\\k&lt;name&gt; 引用\"\n      \"$&lt;name&gt; 替换\"\n      解构赋值友好\n    标志位\n      g 全局\n      i 忽略大小写\n      m 多行\n      s dotAll\n      u Unicode\n      v unicodeSets\n      y sticky\n      d hasIndices\n    sticky 模式\n      精确位置匹配\n      词法分析利器\n      lastIndex 控制\n    hasIndices\n      捕获组索引\n      indices 属性\n      ES2022 新特性</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>命名捕获组</strong> <code>(?&lt;name&gt;...)</code> 为分组赋予语义化名称，通过 <code>groups.name</code> 访问。</li>\n<li><code>\\k&lt;name&gt;</code> 在模式内反向引用命名组，<code>$&lt;name&gt;</code> 在替换字符串中引用。</li>\n<li>JavaScript 共有 8 个标志位，分别控制匹配行为、字符处理、位置定位和元信息生成。</li>\n<li><strong><code>y</code>（sticky）标志</strong>从 <code>lastIndex</code> 精确位置开始匹配，适合词法分析场景。</li>\n<li><strong><code>d</code>（hasIndices）标志</strong>生成每个捕获组的精确索引范围，便于需要位置信息的文本处理。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"命名分组与标志位","id":"命名分组与标志位"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"命名捕获组","id":"命名捕获组"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":3,"text":"图示","id":"图示"},{"level":2,"text":"命名组在替换中的应用","id":"命名组在替换中的应用"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":2,"text":"正则标志位全览","id":"正则标志位全览"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":3,"text":"图示","id":"图示"},{"level":2,"text":"sticky 标志与 lastIndex","id":"sticky-标志与-lastindex"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":2,"text":"hasIndices 标志","id":"hasindices-标志"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":3,"text":"图示","id":"图示"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Unicode 与国际化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/regex-text-processing/advanced-patterns/unicode-and-internationalization"},"next":{"title":"NFA 与 DFA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/regex-text-processing/regex-engines/nfa-vs-dfa"}}